  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sewing For Hope</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to introduce a group of up to 45 women to professional sewing. We currently have10 sewing machines and one trainer. Women were trained over the course of 6-9 months, after which they have acquired a specific and employable skills.  With this fundraiser Partners For Conservation aims to purchase 35 additional sewing machines and materials to enable women to work together towards their social economic inclusion and welfare. Please watch the video for more information.</narrative>
  </description>
